		{
			description: [
				"The winds of the End whisper of a fortress long forgotten. Legends tell of the Ruined Citadel, where ancient power lies sealed behind shattered walls. To uncover its secrets, you must follow the Eye into the Void and seek out this forsaken stronghold."
				""
				"But beware! Deep within the Citadel lurks the Ender Guardian, a foe of immense strength who has claimed the lives of many who came chasing fortune."
				""
				"Will you venture forward and face the Guardian, or retreat to the safety of the Overworld and leave the Citadel’s mysteries undiscovered?"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ruined_citadel.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
			]
