			dependencies: ["5FFF41B9B9D5FA13"]
			description: [
				"Your pillaging does not go unnoticed. As you round the corner the Ender Golem awakens. You must defeat it to prove yourself worthy of pressing deeper into the Citadel. "
				""
				"From its remains you will claim a Void Core, a rare material said to be essential in crafting the Forge Rocket Nose Cone."
