		{
			dependencies: ["326B4A7C0547EA69"]
			description: [
				"Deep within the Citadel stands the Ender Guardian, a towering foe strong enough to withstand the mightiest blows. Many have faced it... none have returned. "
				""
				"The Ender Guardian’s attacks are brutal. It can send you flying into the air, rush through the arena with a devastating charge, and call upon Void Runes that unleash blasts of energy. At half health, it will shatter the very floor of the arena, dragging you into a lower level where the battle rages on."
				""
				"Should you be victorious, the Guardian will fall and drop the Gauntlet of the Guard. This relic grants you the ability to construct the Tier 5 Rocket, the key to advancing beyond the End."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ender_guardian.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
			]
			id: "01281CDF6BEF857C"
			rewards: [
